@danielchalef you're the only one who's touched the Makefile, so flagging this rather than letting it sit.

`make test` runs `$(PYTEST) -m "not integration"` with no path, so pytest collects from the repo root and picks up files outside `tests/`. Adding `tests/` scopes collection. One line, fixes #1180.

Low priority — just wanted to check it's not intentional before it goes stale.
